    "Optional, local statistics for KeyDock actions only. Stores command IDs, outcomes, durations and dates for 30 days. No window titles, arguments, clipboard text or model input is recorded. This is partial coverage, not whole-computer tracking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可选的本地统计，仅记录 KeyDock 内的操作。命令 ID、结果、耗时和日期保留 30 天；不记录窗口标题、参数、剪贴板文本或模型输入。统计仅覆盖已记录的操作，不追踪整台电脑。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional, local statistics for KeyDock actions only. Stores command IDs, outcomes, durations and dates for 30 days. No window titles, arguments, clipboard text or model input is recorded. This is partial coverage, not whole-computer tracking."
          }
