    "Requests go directly to this endpoint. Input is sent only when an AI action runs. Keys are stored in Keychain, never in configuration or logs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requests go directly to this endpoint. Input is sent only when an AI action runs. Keys are stored in Keychain, never in configuration or logs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求直接发送至此端点，仅在运行 AI 动作时发送输入内容。密钥保存在钥匙串中，不写入配置或日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Requests use their start time in this range; the end is exclusive. The ledger retains up to 90 days within count and storage limits. Action statistics and their AI summary do not include this ledger.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requests use their start time in this range; the end is exclusive. The ledger retains up to 90 days within count and storage limits. Action statistics and their AI summary do not include this ledger."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求按开始时间归入范围，不含结束时刻。账本在数量与容量预算内最多保留 90 天。动作统计及其 AI 总结不包含此账本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
