    },
    "This deletes saved task text and temporary captures. Ordinary session results, task metadata and running work are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This deletes saved task text and temporary captures. Ordinary session results, task metadata and running work are kept."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会删除已保存的任务文本和临时捕获内容，普通会话结果、任务元数据和运行中的工作保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This discards finished task output, retained text for those finished tasks, idle unsaved AI drafts, command suggestions and the Tools text input with its source. Running tasks are kept. Terminal commands may still be running; clearing history does not stop them. Saved commands, settings, credentials and clipboard history are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This discards finished task output, retained text for those finished tasks, idle unsaved AI drafts, command suggestions and the Tools text input with its source. Running tasks are kept. Terminal commands may still be running; clearing history does not stop them. Saved commands, settings, credentials and clipboard history are kept."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会丢弃已结束任务的输出及对应保留文本、闲置且未保存的 AI 草稿、命令建议，以及工具页输入和来源。运行中的任务会保留。终端命令可能仍在运行，清除历史不会停止它们。已保存命令、设置、凭据和剪贴板历史不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This draft changed. Cancel and reopen the close review to check its current input.": {
