            "value": "Agent 因无法核实已报告用量而暂停，未继续调用工具或模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Budgets are frozen when a run starts. Profile edits affect new runs; pause the current run to stop it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Budgets are frozen when a run starts. Profile edits affect new runs; pause the current run to stop it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任务开始时会固定用量限制。修改配置仅影响新任务；停止当前任务请使用暂停。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Counts include reported input and output tokens. Missing or conflicting usage pauses the run. A request can exceed this threshold before its usage is returned; this is not a billing hard limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Counts include reported input and output tokens. Missing or conflicting usage pauses the run. A request can exceed this threshold before its usage is returned; this is not a billing hard limit."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "计数包含已报告的输入和输出 token。用量缺失或冲突时暂停任务。单次请求可能在返回用量前超出阈值，不能保证账单硬上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter a valid positive run token threshold.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter a valid positive run token threshold."
          }
